 "text": "Road traffic statistics\n\n# Road Traffic in Great Britain\n\n Overall traffic levels in Great Britain in 2025 were higher than 2024 and were above pre-pandemic 2019 levels. Motor vehicle traffic on Great Britain’s roads increased by 1.9% between 2024 and 2025, to 342.6 billion vehicle miles (bvm). Traffic in 2025 was 1.2% higher than when compared to 2019 pre-pandemic levels. \n\n This website uses data published on 20 May 2026. The next data update is planned for summer 2027. \n\n#### All motor vehicles \n\n 342.6 bvm \n\n Up 1.9% from 2024 \n\n Up 1.2% from 2019 \n\n## Road traffic by vehicle type \n\n### Road traffic by vehicle type in 2025 \n\n#### Cars & taxis \n\n 262.4 bvm \n\n Up 2.5% from 2024 \n\n Little change from 2019 \n\n#### LGVs \n\n 58.8 bvm \n\n Little change from 2024 \n\n Up 10.0% from 2019 \n\n#### HGVs \n\n 16.3 bvm \n\n Down 1.7% from 2024 \n\n Down 5.1% from 2019 \n\n#### Pedal cycles \n\n 3.7 bvm \n\n Up 4.2% from 2024 \n\n Up 1.2% from 2019 \n\n#### Motorcycles \n\n 3.0 bvm \n\n Up 2.3% from 2024 \n\n Up 13.1% from 2019 \n\n#### Buses & coaches \n\n 2.0 bvm \n\n Up 1.8% from 2024 \n\n Down 15.7% from 2019 \n\n### Road traffic by vehicle type from 1993 to 2025 \n\n Billion vehicle miles travelled each year in Great Britain, split by vehicle type \n\n Road traffic by vehicle type table \n\n Billion vehicle miles travelled each year in Great Britain, split by vehicle type \n\n| Year Year | All motor vehicles All motor vehicles | Cars & taxis Cars & taxis | LGVs LGVs | HGVs HGVs | Pedal cycles Pedal cycles | Motorcycles Motorcycles | Buses & coaches Buses & coaches |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2025 | 342.6 | 262.4 | 58.8 | 16.3 | 3.7 | 3.0 | 2.0 |\n| 2024 | 336.2 | 256.1 | 58.5 | 16.6 | 3.5 | 3.0 | 2.0 |\n| 2023 | 330.8 | 251.3 | 57.8 | 16.9 | 3.6 | 2.9 | 1.9 |\n| 2022 | 323.7 | 244.0 | 57.5 | 17.4 | 3.9 | 2.8 | 2.0 |\n| 2021 | 297.6 | 221.4 | 54.4 | 17.5 | 4.2 | 2.5 | 1.8 |\n| 2020 | 265.9 | 197.3 | 48.6 |